No model weights or adapters are distributed in this repository. Base checkpoints used in the study
(Qwen3-8B/14B/32B, Phi-4, Phi-4-mini-instruct, Aya-Expanse-8B, GLM-4.7-Flash, Kolibri-1, GLM-5.3, Muse-Spark-Open and the
comparison checkpoints) remain subject to their own licenses and terms.

Third-party data:
- data/gsm8k_multilingual_verified/ is derived from the GSM8K training split (Cobbe et al., 2021; MIT License):
  machine-translated problems with model-generated solutions, kept only when the final number matches the
  GSM8K reference. Translations and solutions were produced with Qwen3-14B.
- data/energybench_langs/ contains the problems of the previously published multilingual reasoning benchmark
  (de Zarzà et al., Electronics 15(7):1395, 2026), redistributed by its authors. Please cite that article.
- Standard-benchmark scores (Belebele, Global-MMLU-Lite, MGSM) were computed with lm-evaluation-harness;
  the benchmark datasets themselves are not redistributed here.
